'''Holding Sector MV-7''' was an area of [[Realspace|space]] above the [[Forest]] [[Moon]] of [[Endor]]. During the [[Battle of Endor]] in the [[Galactic Civil War]], [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]] ordered [[Green Squadron (Rebel Alliance)|Green Squadron]] to stay at Holding Sector MV-7 while the rest of the [[Rebel Alliance Navy|Alliance Fleet]] forces took evasive action after it was discovered that they were being jammed and that the [[deflector shield]] of the [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station]] was still active.<ref name="Episode VI" />

